# One line ending in the repository, whatever a contributor's platform does locally.
#
# This matters more here than in most repositories: several committed artifacts are compared BYTE for byte
# — the vendored rule contract, the capability manifest, the canary map and rule — and CRLF slipping into
# one of them turns a cross-repository agreement check into a diff nobody can read.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Bun's binary lockfile. Marked so a diff never mangles it and `text=auto` never guesses.
*.lockb binary
